  "description": "Fitted to a clean recording of the machine, BD 909 Clean Long A 04 (TR-909 From Mars): Decay long, Tune at its lowest. A short 27-semitone sweep (about 160 Hz at 5 ms, 67 Hz at 20 ms) settles at 49 Hz on C4, the recording's pitch, within 40 ms; the body holds 65 ms, then falls over 430 ms. A biased drive makes the body lopsided, its negative half-cycles taller, and a zero-attack square edge opens it on a negative step. Long and soft, for EDM and slower trance.",
